{"id": "1603473", "name": "השפעה של שיחלוף, הופכית, כפל בסקלר וחזקה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא מטריצה הפיכה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> בגודל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\times {{CT:0}}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det (A)={{CT:1}}\\)</span>. מה הדטרמיננטה של המטריצה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(B={{CT:2}}\\cdot A^{{{CT:3}}}\\cdot A^t\\cdot A^{-1}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det(B)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערות:<br>הדרך להזנת חזקה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a^b\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{a^b}\\)</span>.<br>הדרך להזנת שבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{a}{b}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{a/b}\\)</span>.<br>הדרך להזנת כפל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\cdot b\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{a*b}\\)</span>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מפרקים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(B)\\)</span> לפי כפליות הדטרמיננטה, ומשתמשים בכלל לכפל בסקלר, למשוחלפת ולהופכית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הכלים</b><br>עבור מטריצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\times{{CT:0}}\\)</span> וסקלר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(\\alpha X)=\\alpha^{{{CT:0}}}\\det(X),\\quad \\det(XY)=\\det(X)\\det(Y),\\quad \\det(X^t)=\\det(X),\\quad \\det(X^{-1})=\\frac{1}{\\det(X)} \\]</p>בכפל בסקלר כל אחת מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> השורות מוכפלת ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>, ולכן הגורם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha^{{{CT:0}}}\\)</span> ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — החישוב</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(B)=({{CT:2}})^{{{CT:0}}}\\cdot\\det(A)^{{{CT:3}}}\\cdot\\det(A)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\det(A)}=({{CT:2}})^{{{CT:0}}}\\cdot({{CT:1}})^{{{CT:3}}} \\]</p>כלומר<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(B)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "flag: is(equal(ans1,ta));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה שגויה</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["alpha", "detA", "n", "power", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}